#. Tag: menuchoice
#: menus.docbook:1400 menus.docbook:2174
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kmail;...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>ការកំណត់</guimenu> <guimenuitem>កំណត់រចនាសម្ព័ន្ធ​ Kmail...</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: menus.docbook:1406
